<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Social Post Failed</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f9fafb;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }
        .header {
            background: #ef4444;
            padding: 48px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 48px 40px;
        }
        .alert-text {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: #b91c1c;
        }
        .info-card {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 32px 0;
        }
        .info-item {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .info-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #64748b;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .value {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1e293b;
        }
        .error-box {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border: 1px solid #fee2e2;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 32px 0;
        }
        .error-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #991b1b;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .error-message {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #b91c1c;
        }
        .content-box {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 32px 0;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #3525CD;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 24px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .footer {
            padding: 32px 40px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }
        .footer p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin: 4px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Social Post Failure</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p class="alert-text">Action Required: Social Publishing Failed</p>
            <p>Hello <%= userName %>,</p>
            <p>We were unable to publish a scheduled social post. Please review the failure details below and take corrective action.</p>

            <div class="info-card">
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="label">Property</div>
                    <div class="value"><%= propertyTitle %> (#<%= propertyId %>)</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="label">Platform</div>
                    <div class="value" style="text-transform: capitalize;"><%= platform %></div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="label">Scheduled Time</div>
                    <div class="value"><%= scheduledFor %></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="error-box">
                <div class="error-label">Error Details</div>
                <div class="error-message"><%= errorMessage %></div>
            </div>

            <p style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Post Caption:</p>
            <div class="content-box">
                <%= caption %>
            </div>

            <p>You may need to reconnect your social account if the session has expired.</p>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="<%= process.env.BASE_URL_FRONTEND %>/settings/social" class="cta-button">Manage Social Connections</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© 2024 PropAI. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>Professional Property Management Simplified.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
